{ In the previous chapter, c4 and Nc3 was used to combat the King's Indian Defence. These two moves can also be played against other black openings as well as an alternative London System. }
1. d4 d5 2. Bf4 e6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Nf3 Bd6 5. Bg3 c5 6. c4 O-O 7. Nc3 *


[Event "London System Repertoire: London System vs cxd4"]
[Date "2018.05.19"]
[Result "*"]
[Variant "Standard"]
[ECO "D00"]
[Opening "Queen's Pawn Game: Accelerated London System"]
[StudyName "London System Repertoire"]
[ChapterName "London System vs cxd4"]
